{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2021-10-05 06:30:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON & JOHNSON ANNOUNCES SUBMISSION OF EMERGENCY USE AUTHORIZATION AMENDMENT TO THE U.S. FDA TO SUPPORT BOOSTER OF ITS SINGLE-SHOT COVID-19 VACCINE', 'text': 'NEW BRUNSWICK, N.J., OCT. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JOHNSON & JOHNSON (NYSE: JNJ) (THE COMPANY) ANNOUNCED IT HAS SUBMITTED DATA TO THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) TO SUPPORT USE OF A BOOSTER SHOT OF THE JOHNSON & JOHNSON COVID-19 VACCINE IN INDIVIDUALS 18 YEARS OF AGE AND OLDER.'}